      "description": "White outlined field with muted placeholder and visible keyboard focus.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\">Group name<input class=\"ds-field\" placeholder=\"A name for your circle\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{display:grid;gap:8px;font-family:'DMSans_600SemiBold',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:#27332D}.ds-field{font-family:'DMSans_400Regular',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#27332D;min-height:48px;padding:0 14px;border:1px solid #E5E8DE;border-radius:9px;background:#FFFFFF}.ds-field::placeholder{color:#6D756E;opacity:1}.ds-field:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #527453;outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter-chip",
      "description": "Pale foliage denotes the selected scope; inactive filters stay quiet.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip ds-chip-active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All posts</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Groups</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-chip{font-family:'DMSans_400Regular',sans-serif;font-size:12px;min-height:36px;padding:0 13px;border:1px solid #E5E8DE;border-radius:7px;background:transparent;color:#6D756E;cursor:pointer}.ds-chip:hover{background:#F0F3E9}.ds-chip-active,.ds-chip-active:hover{font-family:'DMSans_500Medium',sans-serif;font-weight:500;background:#E8EEE1;color:#2F5843;border-color:#D3DEC8}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #527453;outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Desktop navigation item",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-active",
      "description": "Selected forest text and pale foliage without decorative elevation.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7M16 3l5 5M9 15l3-1L22 4l-3-3L9 11z\"/></svg>Your space</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{background:#F1F3EB;padding:12px;max-width:190px}.ds-nav-item{font-family:'DMSans_600SemiBold',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:#2F5843;background:#E8EEE1;border:0;min-height:45px;padding:0 15px;border-radius:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-item:hover,.ds-nav-item:active{background:#E8EEE1}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #527453;outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Information card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "post-card",
      "description": "Identity, informative title and useful excerpt lead a flat white post card.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-post\"><div class=\"ds-post-meta\"><span class=\"ds-avatar\">MP</span><strong>Maya Patel</strong><span class=\"ds-post-audience\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"M12 17v2\"/></svg>Design circle</span></div><button class=\"ds-post-title\">The best design decision is sometimes subtraction.</button><p class=\"ds-post-body\">I removed three steps from our onboarding today. Fewer things between someone and what they came to do.</p><div class=\"ds-post-footer\">2 useful <span>1 reply</span></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-post{font-family:'DMSans_400Regular',sans-serif;padding:22px;border:1px solid #E5E8DE;border-radius:16px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#27332D;display:grid;gap:14px}.ds-post-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px}.ds-post-meta strong{font-family:'DMSans_600SemiBold',sans-serif;font-weight:600;}.ds-avatar{font-family:'DMSans_600SemiBold',sans-serif;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#F6E8DD;color:#99643F;font-size:10px}.ds-post-audience{font-family:'DMSans_500Medium',sans-serif;font-weight:500;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:5px;background:#F6E8DD;color:#99643F;font-size:10px}.ds-post-title{font-family:'DMSans_600SemiBold',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:27px;letter-spacing:-.4px;color:#27332D;text-align:left;background:transparent;border:0;padding:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-post-title:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #527453;outline-offset:4px;}.ds-post-body{font-size:13px;line-height:22px;color:#697167;margin:0}.ds-post-footer{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;color:#6D756E;border-top:1px solid #F0F1EB;padding-top:8px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Composer audience signature",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "audience-self",
      "description": "Three actual composer audience states demonstrate the coupled glyph, identity tint and privacy explanation. Examples use the demonstration names.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-audiences\"><section class=\"ds-audience-state\"><button class=\"ds-audience ds-self\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"M12 17v2\"/></svg>Just me <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button><p class=\"ds-privacy\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"M12 17v2\"/></svg>Only you can see this</p></section><section class=\"ds-audience-state\"><button class=\"ds-audience ds-person\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"5\"/><path d=\"M20 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0\"/></svg>Maya Patel <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button><p class=\"ds-privacy\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"M12 17v2\"/></svg>Only you and Maya</p></section><section class=\"ds-audience-state\"><button class=\"ds-audience ds-group\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14M3 3h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5v17h-5a4 4 0 0 0-4 1 4 4 0 0 0-4-1H3z\"/></svg>Good reads <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button><p class=\"ds-privacy\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"M12 17v2\"/></svg>Visible to 5 group members</p></section></div>",
      "css": ".ds-audiences{display:grid;gap:20px}.ds-audience{font-family:'DMSans_500Medium',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border:0;border-radius:7px;min-height:36px;padding:0 10px;max-width:240px;cursor:pointer}.ds-self{background:#E4ECDD;color:#4F6945}.ds-person{background:#F6E8DD;color:#99643F}.ds-group{background:#ECE8F4;color:#776196}.ds-audience:hover,.ds-audience:active{opacity:.85}.ds-audience:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #527453;outline-offset:4px;}.ds-privacy{font-family:'DMSans_400Regular',sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;color:#6D756E;margin:10px 0 0}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Private Garden Club Bulletin",
    "overview": "Rabbit is a calm writing and reading space for friends and small communities. Its warm paper ground, forest actions and softly colored circles make sharing feel personal and deliberate. DM Sans keeps the interface familiar and legible; information and recipients supply the character.\n\nThe interface is spacious around the primary task and compact around its supporting metadata. White panels, light strokes and quiet controls frame useful posts. The distinctive audience control changes its icon, tint and privacy explanation together before publication.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm paper ground with white reading and writing surfaces.",
      "One forest action color and five consistent identity tones.",
      "Readable DM Sans with compact, sentence-case controls.",
      "Visible recipients and privacy wording before posting.",
      "Flat panels and restrained state feedback."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Audience Agreement Rule",
        "body": "In the composer, recipient glyph, identity tone and privacy explanation change together. A color change alone is insufficient.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reading First Rule",
        "body": "Use semibold titles, regular reading text and quieter metadata; keep action labels subordinate to the information they serve.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Paper Surface Rule",
        "body": "Separate resting panels with a white fill and a light border. Do not add decorative elevation to reading cards.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the JS theme palette for app surfaces and the paired tone foregrounds for identity badges.",
      "Do keep the composer audience visible and update its icon, tint and privacy wording together.",
      "Do preserve actual DM Sans weight assets on web and native.",
      "Do keep controls quiet, keyboard focus visible and explanatory text readable.",
      "Do adapt the rail and support column to the observed breakpoints while preserving the three primary destinations."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't use group colors to replace the primary action color.",
      "Don't add decorative shadows to reading cards.",
      "Don't use the faint color for composer placeholders; use muted.",
      "Don't treat the available dark token declarations as a shipped dark appearance.",
      "Don't turn the existing uppercase sidebar category label into a reusable heading style."
    ]
  }
}
